# PART 14. FINAL DATABASE STRUCTURE

## 14.1 Database Name

```text
national_robotics_competition
```

The database stores information related to schools, participants, teams, robots, competitions, rounds, judges, scores, and awards.

---

# 14.2 Final Tables

The database contains 13 main tables.

| No. | Table              | Description                      |
| --: | ------------------ | -------------------------------- |
|   1 | `school`           | Stores school information        |
|   2 | `participant`      | Stores competition participants  |
|   3 | `team`             | Stores robotics teams            |
|   4 | `team_participant` | Connects participants and teams  |
|   5 | `category`         | Stores competition categories    |
|   6 | `competition`      | Stores competition information   |
|   7 | `competition_team` | Connects competitions and teams  |
|   8 | `round`            | Stores competition rounds        |
|   9 | `robot`            | Stores robots belonging to teams |
|  10 | `judge`            | Stores judge information         |
|  11 | `round_judge`      | Connects judges and rounds       |
|  12 | `score`            | Stores team scores               |
|  13 | `award`            | Stores competition awards        |

---

