# 14.5 Main Relationships

The database contains both one-to-many and many-to-many relationships.

### One-to-Many

```text
SCHOOL 1 ──── M PARTICIPANT
SCHOOL 1 ──── M TEAM
TEAM 1 ──── M ROBOT
CATEGORY 1 ──── M COMPETITION
COMPETITION 1 ──── M ROUND
ROUND 1 ──── M SCORE
TEAM 1 ──── M SCORE
COMPETITION 1 ──── M AWARD
TEAM 1 ──── M AWARD
```

### Many-to-Many

```text
PARTICIPANT M ──── N TEAM
        through TEAM_PARTICIPANT
```

```text
COMPETITION M ──── N TEAM
        through COMPETITION_TEAM
```

```text
ROUND M ──── N JUDGE
        through ROUND_JUDGE
```

